From: Really Board Support <build@really.local>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rockchip: really: boot USB, TF, M.2 SATA, then eMMC

Boot removable USB first, then the removable microSD card, then the M.2
SATA disk, and finally the onboard eMMC.

---

diff --git a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/board.c b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/board.c
--- a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/board.c
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/board.c
@@ -325,0 +326 @@ int board_late_init(void)
+	env_set("boot_targets", "usb mmc1 scsi mmc0");
--
2.43.0
